# The format check covers the Node project's own files only (T07, #57): JavaScript and
# JSON in scripts/ and tests/, and the root config files. Docs, content, and the sandbox
# kit are not reformatted.
# The vendored Sumi code (src/ outside the directories below, astro.config.ts, public/) keeps
# upstream's own formatting (T09, #58), so our changes stay a readable diff against upstream for
# the monthly upstream watch. ESLint and astro check cover src/.
# Project-owned directories under src/ are formatted: each is re-included below
# (a child of an ignored directory cannot be re-included on its own).
/*
!/scripts/
!/tests/
!/src/
/src/*
!/src/lib/
!/src/i18n/
!/package.json
!/tsconfig.json
!/tsconfig.tools.json
!/*.config.js
!/.prettierrc.json
**/*.md
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml
# Existing JSON kept byte-for-byte (a fixture and the Codex result schema).
/scripts/codex-result.schema.json
/tests/scripts/main-watch/fixtures/
# Recorded screenshot baselines.
/tests/e2e/__screenshots__/
